# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform. Without this
# a Windows checkout rewrites every text file to CRLF, the mixed-line-ending
# hook rewrites it back, and every commit carries a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary

# The figures are generated; a diff of their bytes tells nobody anything. What
# matters is the digest stamp inside them, which `emotion-timeline figures
# --check` verifies.
assets/*.png -diff linguist-generated

# Committed evidence rather than source: keep it out of the language stats.
benchmarks/** linguist-documentation
